Fixed the IP Fabric adapter queueing objects for deletion on the adapter class rather than the instance, which let a run that failed part way leave objects for a later run in the same worker to delete.
Fixed the IP Fabric adapter inserting an Interface before validating it, which left an invalid Interface in Nautobot when validation then failed.
Fixed Bulk Write Mode discarding every IP Address whose containing Prefix Nautobot did not already hold, rather than creating the Prefix as a per-object sync does.
Fixed the IP Fabric adapter rejecting an IP Address whose only containing Prefix is longer than the mask IP Fabric reports for it, and creating a redundant wider Prefix while doing so.
